Recorded protocol fixtures for the telephony connectors (docs/telephony.org).

They are written from the providers' public API documentation, not captured
from a live account, and use only fictional numbers (555-01xx) and
example.com hosts. Field names that still need confirming against a live
account are listed in docs/telephony.org, "What is from public documentation".

3cx-*.json        3CX call control API (token, makecall) and the CRM
                  integration's call journal posted to Venture's webhook.
voipms-*.json     VoIP.ms REST API answers (sendSMS, sendMMS, an error).
voipms-*.query    VoIP.ms SMS/MMS URL callback query strings, as the
                  callback URL placeholders fill them in. {MEDIA_ORIGIN}
                  is replaced by the test's fake media server.
